<body><h1>Carfolk — local enquiry testing</h1>
<p><strong>Developer testing only. This is NOT Carfolk's approved public privacy notice.</strong></p>
<p>This local copy of Carfolk may accept invented names, phone numbers, email addresses, and messages to test the enquiry and viewing workflows. Submitted records are stored in your <strong>local PostgreSQL database</strong> and displayed to your local administrator.</p>
<p>Use fictitious information only. Do not enter personal details belonging to real customers or enable this option on public hosting.</p>
<p>Delete test records from your local database when finished, and turn off <code>CARFOLK_LOCAL_ENQUIRIES_ENABLED</code>. Production submissions remain disabled until Carfolk approves its formal privacy policy and operational processes.</p>
<p><a href="http://localhost:5173/#/contact">Return to local contact form</a></p></body></html>
